x-w-2xl text-lg text-neutral-400","children":["$","p",null,{"children":"负责供电、驱动、传感器和线束，让每个模块可靠地连在一起。"}]}]]}]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8 py-20 sm:py-24","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto w-full max-w-2xl lg:max-w-none","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"grid items-start gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_280px] lg:gap-16","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"children":["$","article",null,{"className":"max-w-3xl","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent","children":["Electrical"," · SPEECH"]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-5 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-white","children":["电控组","演讲稿"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 space-y-6 text-base leading-8 text-neutral-300 sm:text-lg sm:leading-9","children":[["$","p","electrical-speech-0",{"className":"whitespace-pre-line","children":"电控到底是什么？\n简单说，机械是骨骼，视觉是眼睛，而电控就是神经系统和大脑。我们负责把算法指令，翻译成电机听得懂的语言，让云台指哪打哪，让底盘丝滑漂移。如果说机械是机器人的基础，那电控就是核心。"}],["$","p","electrical-speech-1",{"className":"whitespace-pre-line","children":"在战队做电控，你会解锁哪些硬核技能？"}],["$","p","electrical-speech-2",{"className":"whitespace-pre-line","children":"第一，嵌入式开发。 你会亲手给STM32芯片写代码，配置各种传感器，体验“代码烧录成功”的狂喜，和“电机突然疯转”的崩溃。\n第二，实时控制。 我们的代码要在毫秒级内完成PID闭环计算，让发射机构稳定在每秒十几发的射频。\n第三，系统联调。 你会成为团队“最被需要的人”——机械问你“为什么不动”，视觉问你“为什么没收到数据”。当你把整台车调通，那种成就感无与伦比。"}],["$","p","electrical-speech-3",{"className":"whitespace-pre-line","children":"零基础怎么办？\n别怕！大一就是最好的试错期。 战队有完整的培训体系，从C语言基础到CubeMX配置，学长学姐手把手带你。只要你对机器人有热情，肯花时间钻研，这绝对是你大学里技术成长最快的一年。"}],["$","p","electrical-speech-4",{"className":"whitespace-pre-line","children":"最后，电控组能给你什么？\n除了嵌入式、控制算法这些写在简历上闪闪发光的技能，更重要的是一群努力调车、并肩作战的战友。当你的机器人站在赛场上，那种血脉偾张的感觉，会让你觉得一切奋斗都值了。"}],["$","p","electrical-speech-5",{"className":"whitespace-pre-line","children":"如果你想让代码驱动钢铁，用逻辑点燃激情，电控组等你来！"}]]}]]}]}],["$","$L7",null,{"children":["$","aside",null,{"className":"border-t border-white/10 pt-7 lg:sticky lg:top-28","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent","children":"ROLE"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-5 font-display text-lg font-semibold text-white","children":"组别信息"}],["$","dl",null,{"className":"mt-6 space-y-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-neutral-500","children":"需要什么"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-300","children":"有一点代码基础更好，没有也可以从hello world开始。"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-neutral-500","children":"零基础可以吗"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-300","children":"可以。培训会从stm32HAL库使用开始。"}]]}]]}],["$","$L8",null,{"href":"/join","className":"group/btn inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full font-semibold tracking-tight transition duration-200 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 bg-accent text-ink hover:bg-accent-soft focus-visible:outline-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm mt-8","children":[["$","span",null,{"children":"返回报名页面"}],["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","className":"transition-transform duration-200 group-hover/btn:translate-x-0.5","children":"→"}]]}]]}]}]]}]}]}]],null],"segment":"__PAGE__?{\"slug\":\"electrical\"}"},"styles":[]}],"segment":["slug","electrical","d"]},"styles":[]}],"segment":"groups"},"styles":[]}]}]}]}],null]
